z1-ipod
========

This project includes code adapted from ryOS
(https://github.com/ryokun6/ryos, commit d989f4dc29e5a8ae0054fd741a485f46949049d8)
by Ryo Lu, licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later.

Adaptation for Z1 / z1han.com by Zihan Huang (黄子涵).
UI credit line: 「z1han.com 改编自 ryOS」

Fonts shipped here:
- ChicagoKare-Regular.woff2 — free Chicago recreation used by upstream ryOS
- EBGaramond-Latin.woff2 — SIL Open Font License
- SourceSans3-Regular.woff2 / SourceSans3-Semibold.woff2 — SIL Open Font License
  (stand-ins for the commercial Myriad Pro and Geneva faces used upstream;
   those commercial fonts are NOT redistributed)

Landscape wallpaper videos from upstream are intentionally omitted from this
repository because of size and unclear redistribution rights. The Landscapes
display mode will show an empty stage unless you add your own videos under
public/ipod/ryos/wallpapers/videos/ and list them in manifest.json.
